  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syria Humanitarian Response Programme: Internal Risk Facility - UNICEF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding UNICEF to response to the cholera outbreak in autumn 2022. This contribution was for the UN Whole of Syria Cholera Response Plan, which sought $35m for October to December 2022, and its successor plan for January - June 2023. UNICEF led the response on Case Management &amp; Infection Prevention and Control (with WHO), Risk Communication and Community Engagement, and Operational Research and Knowledge Management (with WHO).</narrative>
  </description>
